OL,3,GNEWSA'This Is Anfield' sign fetches
OL,4,A#115k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original "This Is Anfield" sign
OL,7,Ffrom Liverpool's stadium tunnel has
OL,8,Ffetched #115,000 under the hammer.
OL,10,FIt sold for almost eight times the
OL,11,Festimated guide price of #15,000,
OL,12,Fauctioneer Budds said.
OL,14,FThe words famously hang above the
OL,15,Fpassage to the pitch and Reds players
OL,16,Ftraditionally touch the sign before
OL,17,Fmatches as they pass. Legendary manager
OL,18,FBill Shankly chose them in 1972 after
OL,19,Frejecting "Welcome To Anfield" as too
OL,20,Ffriendly.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
