OL,3,GNEWSA'This Is Anfield' sign fetches
OL,4,A#115k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original sign was removed in the
OL,7,F1970s and given to Ronald Wilson, a
OL,8,Fformer member of the club's boys' team,
OL,9,Fwhose family displayed it in an Isle of
OL,10,FMan hotel for more than 20 years -
OL,11,Funtil now.
